CM_ SG_ 1150 ICC_DriveDrosinessLevel "0x0: not available;驾驶员在位检测输出“不在位”的时候触发
0x1: unknown;驾驶员不疲劳的默认状态
0x2: not fatigue;驾驶员不疲劳
0x3: lightly fatigue轻度疲劳,;
0x4: moderate fatigue中度疲劳;
0x5: severe fatigue重度疲劳;
0x6~0x7: Reserved";
